    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FRUITOPIA, a quiet world, without fuss, inhabited by FRUIX and VEGANS.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, everything changes and the two clans have a blast...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live in this original world, in a universe where fierce battles become one!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOOT: Loot, crates to search in different maps where you can find many objects, weapons, health, armor, etc... Essential to your survival!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SURVIVE: Stand until time runs out by assisting or fighting against your opponents.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WIN: Be number one in the game to enrage your enemies!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your weapons for the next round!</p>",
